From: Open-Wine-Components <fixes@proton-ge-custom>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:05:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] utilities: Skip extra mount drives for Where Winds Meet or when DISABLE_EXTRA_DRIVES=1

Proton's default behavior mounts /media, /run/media, /mnt, and ~ as extra DOS
drives (u:, v:, w:, x:). When running Where Winds Meet, detect.dll scans all
mounted drives and traverses Steam compatdata symlinks recursively, causing an
infinite directory traversal loop and 100% CPU lockup at 'Dump Inited'.

Skip setting up extra mount drives when DISABLE_EXTRA_DRIVES=1 or when the
game ID indicates Where Winds Meet.
---
--- a/utilities.py
+++ b/utilities.py
@@ -53,6 +53,15 @@
 
 def setup_mount_drives(func: Callable[[str, str, str], None]) -> None:
     """Set up mount point drives for proton."""
+    if os.environ.get('DISABLE_EXTRA_DRIVES', '0') == '1':
+        return
+    game_id = (
+        os.environ.get('UMU_ID', '')
+        or os.environ.get('GAMEID', '')
+        or os.environ.get('SteamGameId', '')
+    )
+    if 'where-winds-meet' in game_id or 'wwm' in game_id:
+        return
     if os.environ.get('UMU_ID', ''):
         drive_map = {
             '/media': 'u:',
